on it describes.\n88\t\n89\t## Health Warnings\n90\t\n91\t- **Missing sections (non-blocking)**: the strategy has no Impacted Teams table, no Dependencies table, no Given/When/Then acceptance criteria, and no NFRs. Team for the Documentation epic was inferred (`RHOAI Documentation`); the Dashboard team was taken from architecture context. ACs below are derived from HLRs plus the audit-report context.\n92\t- **Scope trap watch**: HLR-3 requires republication of the VPAT — publication channels and review cadence for conformance statements may involve process steps outside the docs team's direct control. Captured as a risk on E002, not as an AC on externally controlled timing.\n93\t- **Out-of-scope boundary**: screen-reader semantics beyond what keyboard fixes require are explicitly out of scope; E001 ACs must not silently expand into semantics work.\n94\t\n95\t## Tiered Delivery\n96\t\n97\tNot applicable — no external dependency with uncertain timing. Both public-sector-customer deliverables (fixes + published VPAT) are internal to this strategy and sequenced linearly.\n98\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bd53d610ad297ba","agent_id":"a253a8b96d51ddd1d","session_id":"eda13005-d007-48b0-bec9-257ea8435cf6","uuid":"9ca4f088-e1f5-4bd8-b74f-2a234ffa6aa9","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:14:38.456Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9008342d454bfcac","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
